From: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 13:15:53 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 277/333] [ae-patch] Turn the security reviewer slot into
 reviewer personas

A reviewer slot now names a persona by id instead of carrying when and focus.
A persona is a name, a purpose, an optional model and effort, a when of always
or risky, an optional trigger and up to 1000 characters of instructions. The
lead notice puts the persona's name, purpose and trigger on the slot's line and
lists the instructions of only the personas the preset uses, quoted line by
line so they cannot pass for notice lines. A persona that no longer exists
reads as a plain reviewer with a note. The roles settings gain a Personas
section (built-in ones read-only with Duplicate, the user's own editable) and a
persona select on each reviewer; reviewer 1 cannot pick a risky persona. The
when and focus fields from the previous patch are removed.
